{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By day you search for answers. By night, the factory comes alive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/63ebd579eb0598cd796da754b20e9ba6.avif?t=1759507874\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/fde583545b421f1208c568f4516d4c1f.webp?t=1759507874\" width=390 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Sergey Ovcharov</strong>, a guard who - together with a handful of survivors - becomes trapped in a labyrinth with no windows, no exits\u2026 only walls that breathe and statues that shouldn\u2019t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/2a17c82fdac0bf3d32e0761b0587e3d1.avif?t=1759507874\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every corridor</strong> hides secrets, every discovery drags you deeper into a story of paranoia and despair. By day you investigate the factory\u2019s mysteries, by night you face its living horror - a presence that feeds on fear and sanity alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pitanie </strong>is more than survival. It is a descent into a uniquely Eastern European nightmare, where nostalgia for scratched DVDs and early internet culture collides with something ancient and inhuman. Hope fades, trust cracks, and the factory waits to claim you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/6dec135804f89c0e626e0b61adeeeeb7.webp?t=1759507874\" width=390 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Factory\u2019s Secret</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinth of rust and snow hides something more than machinery - the plant itself breathes, whispers, and watches your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conversations Unlike Any Other.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue isn\u2019t just text. Characters talk like real people of the 2000s - blunt, awkward, emotional. Each line feels raw, unfiltered, and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/68bf3961331ba4b1b856ad0b63b80bb6.avif?t=1759507874\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Cycle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day you explore, investigate, and search for answers. By night the factory shows its true face, trapping you in suffocating encounters with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic 2000s Eastern Europe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT monitors, scratched DVDs, emo subculture, and the first wave of internet culture - an atmosphere rarely seen in games, recreated with painful precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Puzzles and Tasks.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lock, device, or broken piece of machinery hides a small story. Minigames are woven seamlessly into exploration and become part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072210?t=1759507874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072210?t=1759507874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/e4d6782bf46bec8b4a39b9e30e59449279b0ddd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759507874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/e4d6782bf46bec8b4a39b9e30e59449279b0ddd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759507874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of violence and disturbing imagery."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By day you search for answers. By night, the factory comes alive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/63ebd579eb0598cd796da754b20e9ba6.avif?t=1759507874\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/fde583545b421f1208c568f4516d4c1f.webp?t=1759507874\" width=390 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Sergey Ovcharov</strong>, a guard who - together with a handful of survivors - becomes trapped in a labyrinth with no windows, no exits\u2026 only walls that breathe and statues that shouldn\u2019t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/2a17c82fdac0bf3d32e0761b0587e3d1.avif?t=1759507874\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every corridor</strong> hides secrets, every discovery drags you deeper into a story of paranoia and despair. By day you investigate the factory\u2019s mysteries, by night you face its living horror - a presence that feeds on fear and sanity alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pitanie </strong>is more than survival. It is a descent into a uniquely Eastern European nightmare, where nostalgia for scratched DVDs and early internet culture collides with something ancient and inhuman. Hope fades, trust cracks, and the factory waits to claim you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/6dec135804f89c0e626e0b61adeeeeb7.webp?t=1759507874\" width=390 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Factory\u2019s Secret</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinth of rust and snow hides something more than machinery - the plant itself breathes, whispers, and watches your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conversations Unlike Any Other.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue isn\u2019t just text. Characters talk like real people of the 2000s - blunt, awkward, emotional. Each line feels raw, unfiltered, and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/extras/68bf3961331ba4b1b856ad0b63b80bb6.avif?t=1759507874\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Cycle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day you explore, investigate, and search for answers. By night the factory shows its true face, trapping you in suffocating encounters with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic 2000s Eastern Europe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT monitors, scratched DVDs, emo subculture, and the first wave of internet culture - an atmosphere rarely seen in games, recreated with painful precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Puzzles and Tasks.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lock, device, or broken piece of machinery hides a small story. Minigames are woven seamlessly into exploration and become part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PitalnikPMG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/3e0d46c34a1150e24bbce76ddefc8280fa9fa7a6/header.jpg?t=1759507874","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"PITANIE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3, Intel Pentium<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3, Intel Pentium<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["PitalnikPMG"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"pegi":{"rating":"18"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"usk":{"rating":"18"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/7584ad87bacaa69d72dc1d448639a814d83a528a/ss_7584ad87bacaa69d72dc1d448639a814d83a528a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759507874","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072210/